# `agents.steer`

Inject a message into a running agent.

**Policy** — command `[C2_ELEVATED]`. Capability `ship.agents.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `slug` | `string` |
| `message` | `string` |

## Returns

`SteerResult` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `slug` | `string` |
| `steered` | `bool` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.steer --json '{ "slug": "", "message": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "slug": "harbor-7f3a9c",
  "steered": true
}
```
